          "notes": "Imported from mim-queue (source_id=mediadive.ingredient:1587); no CAS-RN or CHEBI/NCIT match. Curator review needed. Reviewed on 2026-05-11 as a formula shorthand for a cerium nitrate hydrate; left unmapped pending exact formula/CAS evidence. The 2026-11-08 source review resolves the former formula/CAS gap with independent primary evidence. The exact hydrate CAS is distinct from the broader MeSH family; see campaign proposal and retained historical notes.",
          "occurrence_statistics": {
            "total_occurrences": 0,
            "media_count": 0
          },
          "supplied_form": [
            {
              "name": "cerium(III) nitrate hexahydrate",
              "cas_rn": "10294-41-4",
              "form": "hexahydrate",
              "notes": "Source-specific formula and CAS establish six waters; no supplier or catalogue is attributed to the original recipe. Independent supplier comparison: Sigma-Aldrich238538."
            }
          ],
          "ontology_mapping.evidence": [
            {
              "evidence_type": "DATABASE_MATCH",
              "source": "https://mediadive.dsmz.de/rest/ingredient/1587",
              "notes": "Exact raw formula Ce(NO3)3 x 6 H2O and CAS10294-41-4 support the hexahydrate; independent supplier and PubChem exact-form evidence is captured in the worker02 campaign."
            },
            {
              "evidence_type": "CURATOR_JUDGMENT",
              "source": "https://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/M0319657.json",
              "notes": "Closest verified eligible broader nitrate family in the captured name/CAS search. NARROW_MATCH emits skos:broadMatch; descriptor is not exact hydrate identity. Registry/identity row retains cas:10294-41-4. An exact SNOMED substance search hit exists but SNOMED is outside the frozen schema OntologySourceEnum."
            }
          ]
        },
