    "scientific_conclusion": "Current acid owner CHEBI:4735 has neutral acid formula/structure supported by the captured official declaration; the two inherited deprotonated/zwitterionic anion aliases are now non-resolving REJECTED_LABEL values. Their absence from other is supported. Preserve current CAS acquisition date and separate salt/anion records; alias correction gives no source/role approval.",
